{"name_en": "Yujiulü Cheluhui", "zh": "車鹿會", "sei": "車", "mei": "鹿會", "zh_full": "郁久閭車鹿會", "sex": "m", "years": [316, null], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "柔然", "role": "外族首領", "place": "漠北", "lat": 46.5, "lon": 105.0, "offices": ["部帥"], "kin": [{"rel": "父", "name": "Mugulü"}, {"rel": "子", "name": "Yujiulü Tunugui"}], "friends": [], "foes": [], "bio": "木骨閭之子。雄健，始有部眾，自號柔然，仍役屬拓跋代國，歲貢馬畜貂皮。冬則南度大漠，夏則還居漠北，逐水草遊牧，其世少戰事。後世北魏太武帝鄙其無知，改其號為蠕蠕。", "stats": [55, 58, 45, 48, 62], "lean": "騎", "conf": "C", "src": "Wikipedia: Yujiulü Cheluhui；魏書·蠕蠕傳"}
{"name_en": "Yujiulü Tunugui", "zh": "吐奴傀", "sei": "吐", "mei": "奴傀", "zh_full": "郁久閭吐奴傀", "sex": "m", "years": [null, null], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "柔然", "role": "外族首領", "place": "漠北", "lat": 46.5, "lon": 105.0, "offices": [], "kin": [{"rel": "父", "name": "Yujiulü Cheluhui"}, {"rel": "子", "name": "Yujiulü Bati"}], "friends": [], "foes": [], "bio": "柔然首領，車鹿會之子，木骨閭之孫。父死繼立，統其部眾，居漠北，役屬拓跋代國。史書只記其世系，事蹟不詳。", "stats": [45, 50, 38, 35, 45], "lean": "騎", "conf": "C", "src": "Wikipedia: Mugulü；Wikipedia: Rouran Khaganate；魏書·蠕蠕傳"}
